        "title": "The diagram shows the process for recycling plastic bottles. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><em>The diagram shows the process for recycling plastic bottles. </em></strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</em></strong></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "description": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GZDzdT5CFoDXJmxViO7lItpugzf\"><em><strong>The diagram shows the process for recycling plastic bottles. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task&nbsp; 1 - Plastic Bottle Recycling Process</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế nhựa để tạo ra sản phẩm mới.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế nhựa - tạo ra c&aacute;c sản phẩm mới</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WC1CdzFMdosCLcxEsW2l4ctEgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>to&agrave;n bộ quy tr&igrave;nh c&oacute; 9 bước</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2VPdMAvPoFqkkxqptzlZnh8gMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>bắt đầu từ việc thu gom chai nhựa v&agrave;o <em>c&aacute;c th&ugrave;ng chứa lớn (large containers) </em>v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c với việc sản xuất c&aacute;c sản phẩm cuối c&ugrave;ng như chai mới, quần &aacute;o v&agrave; đồ gia dụng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> 4 bước đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QRDzd5pRaow8VbxJ5AvlENkBgHe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>chai nhựa được thu gom v&agrave;o <strong>c&aacute;c th&ugrave;ng chứa c&oacute; b&aacute;nh xe (wheeled containers)</strong> trước khi được vận chuyển bằng xe tải đến trung t&acirc;m t&aacute;i chế.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Olr7d0R1yoweOcxTQDjlZGSLgHf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>tại trung t&acirc;m, c&aacute;c vật liệu được ph&acirc;n loại để <strong>loại bỏ những thứ kh&ocirc;ng ph&ugrave; hợp (remove any unsuitable items).</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D1TRdX4JVou2IAxhL2blUGQqgCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>những chai đ&atilde; được ph&acirc;n loại <strong>được &eacute;p th&agrave;nh khối (compressed into compact blocks)</strong>, sau đ&oacute; <strong>được nghiền n&aacute;t (be crushed)</strong> th&agrave;nh <strong>nhiều miếng nhỏ (smaller pieces).</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 5 bước c&ograve;n lại của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WUi4dECVWodeH6xDzW5lfGCUg6e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&aacute;c mảnh nghiền được rửa sạch trước khi được chế biến th&agrave;nh <strong>hạt nhựa (plastic pellets)</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XTD7d1uAjoQvwkxaM9plVbFnghe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>sau đ&oacute;, c&aacute;c hạt nhựa n&agrave;y được l&agrave;m n&oacute;ng để chuyển th&agrave;nh <strong>nguy&ecirc;n liệu th&ocirc; (raw materials).</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Scxfdrfu1or8OTxh7jalCaWSgnb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">nguy&ecirc;n liệu th&ocirc; n&agrave;y được sử dụng để sản xuất ra nhiều sản phẩm mới, bao gồm &aacute;o thun, chai nhựa v&agrave; c&aacute;c vật dụng kh&aacute;c.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1628,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SZyQdcCraoUxOHxjBn5lzpZRgLh\">The diagram illustrates the process of recycling plastic bottles into new products.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18137,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1629,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WL0ydJAd6opK3pxR8O7lmzJXggf\">The process undergoes 9 stages, beginning with the initial stage where plastic bottles are collected in large containers, and ending with the manufacturing of final products such as new bottles, clothing, and household items.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18137,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1630,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GaJpd3wj7oQ60SxPjDwl13iHgvd\">In the first stages of the process, plastic bottles are collected in large wheeled containers before being transported to a recycling center by trucks. At the center, the materials are sorted to remove any unsuitable items. Following this, the sorted bottles are compressed into compact blocks, which are then crushed into smaller pieces.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18137,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1631,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLPrd8NDloAyP1xY3kTlNfxugsh\">The latter stages of the process involve several transformations. First, the crushed pieces are washed before being processed into plastic pellets. After that, these pellets are then heated to be converted into raw material. Finally, this raw material is manufactured into various new products, including t-shirts, plastic bottles, and other items.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18137,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
